	(text "VISIBLE WIRING: hierarchy ports sit on their functional nets; the divider midpoint and protected bus are explicitly joined; unused pins remain explicit NoConn."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 169.164 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d8ad96d-4ee7-45e6-b84a-038d942adb8a")
	)
	(text "LM74502 OV is tied low in Rev.A1; positive surge is NOT claimed as closed. The 48V source/cable transient must be measured and kept inside the controller/downstream qualification envelope."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 146.558 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(thickness 0.3048)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "398a25d0-4c9c-455e-a85b-e0d83d28486f")
	)
	(text "VBUS_ADC divider = 280k + 280k over 39k, plus 10nF at the ADC node. Keep the high-side resistors split for voltage stress and route the sense return away from commutation current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "775b2f57-e667-42bd-9687-b8270645d792")
	)
	(text "D1 remains a DNP TVS footprint until clamping voltage is selected from the actual source impedance. F1 is a local placeholder; upstream source-rated over-current protection is mandatory."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 150.876 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(thickness 0.3048)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8fdb0441-97b6-444b-b1f3-dc1f0ca910c4")
	)
	(text "Q7/Q8 are back-to-back N-MOSFETs driven by LM74502 for low-loss reverse-polarity protection. The controller has no reverse-current blocking when enabled, so regeneration can return to a receptive source."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(thickness 0.3048)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "93655499-e890-4053-97c5-b74ab0b4324a")
	)
	(text "DC INPUT -> FUSE -> LM74502 + BACK-TO-BACK NFET RPP -> LOCAL DC-LINK"
